		(descr "HOAUC HYCW417-USBC24-180B vertical USB Type-C 24P receptacle, IPX8, H 10.0, shell legs 1.8 (LCSC C5342202). 24 SMD signal pads 0.27 x 1.30 at 0.50, row pitch 3.30; 4 plated THT shell slots 1.30 x 0.80 (EasyEDA pads 1.70 x 1.20 grown to 1.80 x 1.30 for a 0.25 JLC FPC annular ring, pin-in-paste) = pad S (GND); 2 NPTH 0.60 locating pegs. Land pattern from the JLCEDA/EasyEDA Official Library (https://lceda.cn/ , https://easyeda.com), package USB-C-SMD_HYCW417-USBC24-180B; checked against HOAUC drawing HYC-2212201742.")
